{"ID":"20240513083135-bxwit8l","Spec":"2","Type":"NodeDocument","Properties":{"custom-sy-readonly":"true","id":"20240513083135-bxwit8l","scroll":"\u0026#123;\u0026quot;rootId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240513083135-bxwit8l\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;startId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240513155416-q9r03zv\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;endId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240513155416-q9r03zv\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;scrollTop\u0026quot;:0,\u0026quot;focusId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240513155416-q9r03zv\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;focusStart\u0026quot;:460,\u0026quot;focusEnd\u0026quot;:460\u0026#125;","title":"197","type":"doc","updated":"20240514143251"},"Children":[{"ID":"20240513155416-q9r03zv","Type":"NodeTable","TableAligns":[0],"Properties":{"colgroup":"width: 949px;","id":"20240513155416-q9r03zv","updated":"20240514143251"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableHead","Data":"thead","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"th","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"倪醫師病案紀錄"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 初診日期：2008-5-1"}]}]}]},{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"姓名"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"164-3 C, JK"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"性別："},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"男"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"年齡及體型"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"40岁1.72米80公斤"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"來診日期："},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"2008-5-9"}]}]},{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"來診原因：\n心痛貫背，吹冷氣時才會出現，20年右耳嗚，是高考後才發生（"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"這個耳鳴有心理的壓和因素"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"），雙側肩痛，時好時差。（"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"這個痛和心包的壓力有關，往往心瓣膜閉塞不全的病人都有這個症狀"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"）\n眼睛白區多血絲"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"}]}]},{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"問診：\n這次是第4次治療，進步中。"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"1、 胸部無痛。"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"2、 睡眠品質好轉。"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"3、 眼紅絲減輕。"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"4、 右耳鳴還有，比上次好轉了。"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"5、 肩膀痛（"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"這個痛和心瓣膜閉合不全有關，往往這種病的人都有這個症狀"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"）"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"6、 雙足溫，無麻木。體力好。"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"}]}]},{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"脈診：脈洪緩，手溫額溫。（"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"脈與夏天相應，爲正常現象，額溫爲陰陽還未完全調和"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"）"}]}]},{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"望診：\n1、舌診：淡黃紅濕\n2、眼診：紅絲減少。（"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"這個紅絲用五行的話來說明就是心之火不能正常下降到下焦小腸，而造成病人心火心之營養返逆流向上焦引起"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"）。"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"}]}]},{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"診斷：近于正常，心包仍有濕熱。"}]}]},{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"解說：\nHT-40號（烏梅丸）（用苦溫化心包之寒濕）。30x2 早晚飯後服\nHT-32號病人還有，還要繼續服用。"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"}]}]}]}]}